OL,3,GNEWSA'Sex offenders should lose right
OL,4,Ato change name'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who got into a relationship
OL,7,Fwith a man she later found was a
OL,8,Fregistered sex offender wants a change
OL,9,Fin the law to stop people like him from
OL,10,Fbeing allowed to legally change their
OL,11,Fname.
OL,13,FJulie Purvin from Warwickshire said the
OL,14,Fman she knew as Jason Brown had been
OL,15,F"very charming" and she was horrified
OL,16,Fwhen she discovered his convictions.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
