OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1787117212
OL,1,W5j 5Q7% w175715 w57574h!555iG2/2
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-% -$%%-%-$%%%%-!"$--%& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Sex offenders should lose right
OL,4,Ato change name'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmily Konstantas, the Chief Executive
OL,7,Fof The Safeguarding Alliance has
OL,8,Fcampaigned to have the law tightened
OL,9,Fand said: "When a person commits such
OL,10,Fan awful crime against some of
OL,11,Fsociety's most innocent people, what
OL,12,Fgives them the right to be able to
OL,13,Ferase their past?"
OL,15,FThe government said it would look at
OL,16,Fwhether the law needs to be
OL,17,Fstrengthened.
